<title>SWEDEN: Sweden wants strict Maastricht interpretation.</title>
<headline>Sweden wants strict Maastricht interpretation.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish Finance Minister Erik Asbrink said on Wednesday he was in favour of a strict interpretation of the Maastricht Treaty criteria.</p>
</text>
